namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTweenManager:DisableTick {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenManager.h#DreamTweenManager:DisableTick
    src   "Disable default Tick function, so you can pause all tween or use CustomTick to do your own tick and use your own DeltaTime.\nThis will only pause the tick with current DreamTweenManager instance, so after load a new level, default Tick will work again, and you need to call DisableTick again if you want to disable tick."
    text  "禁用默认的 Tick 函数，以便您可以暂停所有 tween 或使用 CustomTick 执行自己的计时，并使用自己的 DeltaTime。\n这只会暂停当前 DreamTweenManager 实例的计时，因此在加载新关卡后，默认的 Tick 将再次生效，并且如果您想禁用计时，则需要再次调用 DisableTick。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenManager:EnableTick {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenManager.h#DreamTweenManager:EnableTick
    src   "Enable default Tick if it is disabled."
    text  "如果已禁用，则启用默认的 Tick。"
    state machine
}

